sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Fintech
  participant G as Mojaly API Gateway
  participant C as Mojaly Core
  participant R as Rafiki / Open Payments
  participant P as Bank / Mobile Partner

  F->>G: Onboard and create API key
  G->>G: Authorize workspace, hash key
  G-->>F: API key

  F->>G: Create quote
  G->>G: Authenticate API key
  G->>C: Check corridor and price route
  C-->>G: Quote
  G-->>F: Quote response

  F->>G: Execute payment
  G->>G: Authenticate API key
  G->>C: Create payment
  C->>C: Select route

  alt Interledger route
    C->>R: Send via Rafiki / Open Payments
    R-->>C: Payment status
  else Hosted partner route
    C->>P: Send payout request
    P-->>C: Payout status
  end

  C->>C: Track settlement
  C-->>G: Payment status
  G-->>F: Payment response
  C-->>F: Webhook event
